<title>BELGIUM: Belgian sugar beet harvest reaches 998,549 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Belgian sugar beet harvest reaches 998,549 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian's sugar beet harvest reached 998,549 tonnes in the week ending October 12, Belgium's Royal Sugar Beet Institute said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Average sugar content of the harvest to date was 16.52 percent.</p>
<p>A breakdown of the harvest follows:</p>
<p>    Week ending		 12/10     05/10    28/09</p>
<p>    Harvest (tonnes)	545,114   394,654   58,782</p>
<p>    Av. sugar (percent)     16.61     16.41    16.45</p>
<p>    Cum.sugar (percent)     16.52     16.42     n/a</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
